# FINAL CLEAN PUBLICATION FIGURE
#
# IMPORTANT FIXES
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. TNW1 / TNW1_proteins / TNW_1 are treated as the SAME genome.
# 2. Feature data are matched using normalized genome IDs.
# 3. TNW1 is checked BEFORE plotting.
# 4. Missing data are NOT silently converted to zero.
# 5. CAFE values remain separate from genome names.
# 6. CAFE labels use light leader lines and do not cross values.
# 7. Genome names are large and bold.
# 8. CAFE values are large and bold.
# 9. Panel values remain separated.
# 10. antiSMASH and dbCAN legends are completely separate.
# 11. Short legends:
#       antiSMASH: NRPS | PKS | Hybrid | TER | Other
#       dbCAN3:    GH | GT | CE | PL | AA | CBM
# 12. No large figure title.
# 13. No numerical labels on feature bars.
# 14. PNG + PDF + TIFF.
# ================================================================================


